#: scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1450cab0cf42ffc87a5a412b1eb49da45469ad48b151b1cb4dce51b3ba8013c2
#. default-sha256: 9acd32c2559840108e7ac9106f70bdd32bdf3f959f195a6b598438797b7fa3c3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His was a power that evoked images of witches or demons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"the unclean and the impure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫触れれば最後、⟪k:5⟫その者の命を奪ってしまう……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf7b1b606c62f1c7f5b8cfeeb6859e09bdea0c9476319f957342551029c2230f
#. default-sha256: f4360d5e8dbdefaecdff5bd605423069c9318105084c3b6db567821e317dd3c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A mere touch was all it took for him to strip man and beast alike of its life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まるでそれこそ、⟪k:1⟫悪魔か魔女……、⟪k:2⟫不浄の者のようではありませんか。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91a96f4d2c39d1b7209abb33a6cb3591f04d0fd80f6304c455e100ae5805e7d2
#. default-sha256: 723fc282ae063bd572f7b8caa6f52fc0ce6a516b2abc58ad93b3fdaf290e229c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God has quite a cruel streak to bestow such a power upon such a beautiful young man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あんなにも美しい外見の青年だというのに、⟪k:1⟫神様は残酷なことを致しますね。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5033a40a88d51bd7aa876ff10f664915e5009fd3cc2ec67b6ae945d21b20cf12
#. default-sha256: 7a97b7464d861eb66678ccb48f749e861eab9abf4a64df682dd1988a4c910ca1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a strange power it was indeed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それにしても、⟪k:1⟫不思議なことでございます。⟪k:2⟫触れるだけで殺めてしまうだなんて……まるでお"
"とぎ話のようですわね。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d2cf1a356c998e4194426125201905aa8456892ec3e58f916128ff0e015945
#. default-sha256: e3d8556cbb2329a85658a667ab8fdac0f717cd07728d51adfab52a596de5687e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Like something confined to words upon the page, it seemed otherworldly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫現実味を帯びない、⟪k:1⟫紙の上で綴られた物語――といっても良いのかもしれません。⟪k:2⟫なかなか、"
"⟪k:3⟫信じがたいことでございます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1dee85989b40f7163bdc4afc9d5246b3d6cc261f930eda74bfc9445e8253807
#. default-sha256: 8598dacc753b8c302c0b872506e4341dba4f1cc86d3c25b8b1f4461e6c6e23e7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, as he had demonstrated to the White-Haired Girl,⟪k:1⟫his peculiar powers were "
"indeed real."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫不可思議な現象とはいえ、⟪k:2⟫彼が実際に見せたように事実なのでございましょう。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 824851e7f52052d2751bf903ede84b50e0da09b9abffc8deb7cdc2c658d31fa8
#. default-sha256: d0a4c397ab66b5192f36ada21cb22d0c07db9f90fb64969ce9a371abb6f28142
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, the world has its fair share of oddities—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それに、⟪k:1⟫往々にして、⟪k:2⟫世の中には不思議なことで溢れておりますわ。⟪k:3⟫ただ、⟪k:4⟫その"
"不思議なことというのは――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 712d550d6c0d5a553e3230dad9ea847ccc32facfb24a67fa41ae0d69638bc743
#. default-sha256: 05ee0667039f322449be91136050e9b8b2eb50d8a63f158b8ccc74aca37c78f5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫it just so happens that those curiosities tend to remain hidden away, known only to a few."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼のように隠されているから、⟪k:1⟫世に広まらないのかもしれませんね。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89e812b39a052aa70381c248a99d7a109cc70c34aa98eb902e3ad41d72419764
#. default-sha256: a2ae317eca97bbcabbd1d587189b620be587c4814e89c32af574274ddfd9153f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Although, you have laid eyes upon a number of unusual phenomena yourself, "
"Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ふふ……。⟪k:1⟫それに、⟪k:2⟫旦那さまはもう、⟪k:3⟫たくさんの不思議な現象を経験されているでしょ"
"う？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4652e3d6ae4b186d06df677f9a44757184c196c08321633f85038df5e962c406
#. default-sha256: 3ce35c2e382641ca949017abca42965c77a02614e01fed99630435b721ecb960
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The doors to the past through which we have passed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This very mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしと一緒に、⟪k:1⟫過去の扉を開いたり……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あるいは、⟪k:4⟫わたくしと歩いたあの屋"
"敷だって……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8df628b5769fec88ec5f622099e4767f4bbe5edbb06b0e73d7d27314691b9969
#. default-sha256: 5eec39840706e442aac78d3932da376949d161938df43633ed560223d42aa050
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And, as a matter of fact, the two of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それに――わたくしや、⟪k:1⟫旦那さまの存在だって。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb86cbabcc8ab20d867b6e69ac9ce50546a90e8d64736ab554c91b6bf612d22d
#. default-sha256: f480ddc5143d8aec74b7a9ba1694ed1740b84f7d3a43677da9c5210346350f89
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as you just saw, the White-Haired Girl found herself enraptured with this man and his "
"accursed power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫さて、⟪k:1⟫そのように、⟪k:2⟫本当に呪われた力を持つ青年に、⟪k:3⟫白い髪の娘はいつの間にか心を奪"
"われておりました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8eba4245aed857f5ab47fa868d5ba5cf224fe789995f3ce7f7716a7a9818e7f4
#. default-sha256: e65b198a744a058fa513a9c15a0d5b75b3dbefd2c3cb1e63b2a7fb9be438efc3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How do you think Michel acted in response to her proclamation?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の告白を聞いたミシェルは、⟪k:1⟫どうしたと思いますか？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 068a7175bf0eb9c167d874ac484c5221839088f61324fe9b45f98ab4072a6ce1
#. default-sha256: c6a74bc2276e6abf5d4cfa92680813fbfd90cb5a1f65b9eb08e027f38d9d3449
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had spent so long refusing to interact with others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫unable⟪k:4⟫ to "
"interact with them. ⟪k:5⟫As such, he was unsure how to respond."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫今までずっと他人との交流を拒んできた――、⟪k:1⟫いいえ、⟪k:2⟫交流出来なかった彼のことですから、"
"⟪k:3⟫当然、⟪k:4⟫どうすればいいのか分からなくなりました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb4526d7db91d57c90c74384a333712cbb95cb26f6e600bd38924005c941a31e
#. default-sha256: 2f55bf9706a952283c299fff83860ffa876f8beee28503b5d6472e63143545c7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After standing there expressionless for a few moments, he muttered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼は無表情で暫く立ち尽くし、⟪k:1⟫ただひとこと、"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b650c54fe485181ee5945c56a614cb6fae6ecb03781e71dbed88b82f0b045163
#. default-sha256: 850a53468e3b87c055349e145039bff528d3859015bb35a4bed238c0ff93af8d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll consider it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫考えます。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6f463af780581d141d81ac6b6afa4f875cc23be90c769b3259cc695899733e8
#. default-sha256: 7c5788d041f863b8fa64cb73d873862814349f9b0c4404e76cc2a4cebe564d46
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And with that, he returned to his chambers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫とだけ言って、⟪k:1⟫自室に戻ってしまったのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df1a001b84f1dc26345df4b5d8ef6ec2299cea6bf8194067ecbffa77e0c150f5
#. default-sha256: 2526bae7258ab8ad9d7717c6d323266f54d5d9b308e806831c86d2f8b2abc7af
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he was not someone who wore his heart on his sleeve,⟪k:1⟫I personally do not believe "
"he was completely devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫こう思うのです。⟪k:2⟫彼の感情表現はとても希薄なものでしたが――決して感情がない"
"わけではないのだと。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c24abb13035739caef20ddd3ba1463784bf3c590cc9354d9649d018e7296e52
#. default-sha256: 94cac2c6eabaae3b4d75490094cb2c5e1410fe92aa2dd018e9bb58786121d934
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had simply forgotten how to express them in his extended solitude."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あまりに長い間、⟪k:1⟫たった一人で暮らしていたがため、⟪k:2⟫表情の作り方を忘れてしまったので"
"しょう。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 129a20e2b30b19a17d500963afd6c7ea3b247361c10c0ef0e60e41aef5069bfa
#. default-sha256: ff8185785eb69300fc3e53773b03454e392dbbc79e6c1d5ff2a907d05ed9b223
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I think he was, in that moment, in a state of complete panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ですから、⟪k:1⟫わたくしが思うに――その時の彼は、⟪k:2⟫最大限に動揺していたと思いますわ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fab551fe52395c6eeee86c19a3a7d5bd25b83e9b31a71c23c394fe6b737d7de
#. default-sha256: 4d83a53335cd5ea26fcc73ab83ab98f56622b3cc19d8afcfd24b6e0df2be37e1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, just assaulted him with a stream of incomprehensible declarations:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だって、⟪k:1⟫彼にとっては理解不能の言葉が連続して紡がれたのですから。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e984fc41a77de76de0661748559d879b73ddb4e9d3994a53fea82962cc84c1a8
#. default-sha256: cd76933b38243dde2e78fc101c6c40a49b1423d356109bb4349707035c99a708
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that, knowing the truth, she still wished to remain in the mansion..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼の秘密を知ってもなお、⟪k:1⟫この屋敷に留まりたいという言葉……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c8ad0d021c3c99fd5e126f8fbf3ae41d8f4c2c530e7db9abf1103208a509984
#. default-sha256: 355931003cdbf9674aeb0156e5b14dbfbcbd25b6caeefc53bc0485c130684926
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and that, knowing the truth, she loved him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫彼の秘密を知ってもなお、⟪k:2⟫彼のことが好きなのだという言葉。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15f9043f5d2f9b14b57b0da6112ad9bc1a6f4845653b3bceb18bc15713e9c4e3
#. default-sha256: 7a485ae1300b1d72241f03288bce782ed9ed7c0e90e9a9dda97eef58665b11a1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The love she had declared for Michel was not a fleeting puppy love;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫there was "
"genuine tenderness and warmth to her words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女の唇が紡いだ、⟪k:1⟫“好き”という言葉は、⟪k:2⟫浮ついた響きではありませんでした。⟪k:3⟫もっと"
"温かく、⟪k:4⟫包み込むようなもの……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 989a684ee7b6be930635c7004c58f697602e1ef2f1e2a6f71380c0fde91e7ce1
#. default-sha256: 37bd9badc381b8d2610eebe2a661c607ca3c3c12c05c637842dc44af4c5b0d18
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had gone through his life shunned, feared, pushed away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To him, that was "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど彼は、⟪k:1⟫他人から疎まれ、⟪k:2⟫怖がられ、⟪k:3⟫忌避され続けてきました。⟪k:4⟫それが普通"
"のことで、⟪k:5⟫好かれることなどありませんでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bc40b419c594e442118ce349bb758cdc83c7497b6ee0b8f39cf90edc49e7b86
#. default-sha256: c388f2ffc202548c482aac7523079cbceefc8c7f2c555841e49c948682b8ef3c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never given anyone reason to have any fondness for him,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫今まで生きていて、⟪k:2⟫一度たりとも。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
